# Railway Deployment Configuration

## 1. Create railway.json
{
  "$schema": "https://railway.app/railway.schema.json",
  "build": {
    "builder": "NIXPACKS"
  },
  "deploy": {
    "startCommand": "php -S 0.0.0.0:$PORT",
    "healthcheckPath": "/api/test"
  }
}

## 2. Deploy Commands
npm install -g @railway/cli
railway login
railway init
railway up
